/graphql.org/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>GraphQL is a query language for APIs, used by companies including Facebook, GitHub, Twitter and PayPal.</li>\n<li>Over the period of the program, I was working on developing the new plugin system in GraphQL that will allow users to extend and customize their development experience and also to make new redesigned components.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Public Lab","company":"GSoC 2019","location":"Kerela, India","range":"December 2019 - January 2020","url":"https://publiclab.org/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>The Google Summer of Code, often abbreviated to GSoC, is an international annual program in which Google awards stipends to students who successfully complete a free and open-source software coding project during the summer. The program is open to university students aged 18 or over</li>\n<li>I served as a Mentor in Public Lab for Image Sequencer Project, a javascript image processing system where you can modify images. It was a really good experience in mentoring students throughout the world and this also, helped to me to learn many new things from co-mentor.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Public Lab","company":"GCI 2019","location":"Kerela, India","range":"May 2019 - August 2019","url":"https://publiclab.org/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>I served as a Mentor in Public Lab for Image Sequencer Project, a javascript image processing system where you can modify images. It was a really good experience in mentoring students throughout the world and this also, helped to me to learn many new things from co-mentor.</li>\n</ul>"}}]},"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"NiDar","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"tracedSVG":"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='277'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20277'%20preserveAspectRatio='none'%3e%3cpath%20d='M111%202c0%202%201%202%203%202%204%200%203%201-1%201h-5c-1-2-3-1-3%201s1%203%202%203c4%200%205%202%201%202-3%200-5%